  type_set_err_element.pcpp - break step of type_set.pcpp:
  an element type is char, bool or choices: not a string (SM0329)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_set_err_element.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_set_err_element.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
